pm@informatik.uni-kiel.dbp.de (Peter Miehle) writes:

..asks about where and how to use some specific objects. It's a spoiler, so..

>I have the Candelabrum, 7 candles, the Bells and the Book.

>What now? What shall I do? Where to use (invoke?) all these things?

Go to the deepest level of gehennom. When you reach about level 53, you
won't find any more stairs down. Instead, there will be ONE square on that
level where you feel a strange vibration under your feet. THERE, exactly in
THAT spot, you need those items you mentioned.
Make sure NONE of them is cursed.
Apply the candles to attach them into the candelabrum.
Light the candelabrum by applying it.
Ring the bell.
Read the book.
If nothing special happens, either one of the things was cursed or
you used them in the wrong order.
